---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Terms of Service">
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <header class="pt-32 pb-12 px-4 border-b border-slate-800 bg-dark-800/50">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Last Updated: May 2026</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-12">
        
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                By accessing or using the StockSentry Telegram bot ("the Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, do not use the Service.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <div class="bg-red-500/10 border-l-4 border-red-500 p-6 rounded-r-lg mb-8">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="alert-triangle" class="w-5 h-5 text-red-500"></i>
                    2. Not Financial Advice (Strict Disclaimer)
                </h2>
                <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    StockSentry is an algorithmic data-processing tool, not a registered investment advisor, broker, or fiduciary.
                </p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400 marker:text-red-500">
                    <li><strong>No Personalization:</strong> Alerts are generated mathematically based on public market data. They do not account for your personal financial situation, risk tolerance, or investment objectives.</li>
                    <li><strong>No Trading Execution:</strong> StockSentry cannot and will not execute trades on your behalf. You are strictly responsible for placing your own trades in your own brokerage account.</li>
                    <li><strong>Risk of Loss:</strong> All trading involves significant risk of loss. Past performance of the algorithm is not indicative of future results.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, StockSentry and its operators shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400 marker:text-brand-500">
                <li>Trading losses incurred after acting on an alert (or failing to act).</li>
                <li>System downtime, delayed messages, or Telegram API failures that result in missed market movements.</li>
                <li>Inaccuracies in third-party data feeds (e.g., Yahoo Finance, Finnhub).</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">4. Acceptable Use & API Limits</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                You agree not to abuse the Service. This includes:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400 marker:text-brand-500">
                <li>Automating commands to the bot via external scripts.</li>
                <li>Attempting to bypass tier limits for tracked tickers or manual checks.</li>
                <li>Reselling or publicly broadcasting StockSentry alerts without explicit permission.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4">
                We reserve the right to rate-limit or terminate accounts that exhibit bot-like or abusive behavior, even on "Unlimited" tiers, to protect overall system integrity.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">5. Governing Law</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Province of Ontario, Canada, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.
            </p>
        </section>

    </main>
</MainLayout>
